      "comment": "EAGLE BREAD (8) was a little disappointing last start at Sale when 5th (28.90) over 510m. Form here at this distance is strong including two wins. Boasts a strong record from this draw with four wins and two minor placings from nine starts. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. FURIOUS FALCON (7) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing seventh (29.00) last time in a Mix 3/4 at Sale. Solid record at the distance winning 12 races. Boasts a strong record from this draw with two wins and two minor placings from five starts. Should be in this for a long way. WESTERN'S NASIAH (5) was out of character last run when missing the frame, finishing fifth (24.61) in a Grade 5 FIN at Sale. Generally fast to begin but always back from the wide draw last time. Shapes as one to consider. DR. AZURE (1) generally performs well from this box.",
